      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bethrezens Tower ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mclans Win ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Win ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Own Arphos Falls",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022What a magnificent victory! The Dark Elves have fallen to our might! Arphos Falls is a major city that will serve us nicely!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Baalhu",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Own North Fort ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022These battles have taken a toll on all of us! We will use this city to rest and build our army!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Own Wotan River ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Wotan River now belongs to us! This is a crucial victory and serves our cause nicely!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Western Falls ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Empire may have lost this city however we know that they will be back. It matters not! We shall be ready for the Empire or anyone else!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Own Runia ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Despite this city not being part of our ultimate agenda, it will do nicely for the moment! We must march onward and capture Arphos Falls, North Fort and Wotan River!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Owning March Fort",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This city has fallen to our might! Soon our enemies in Arphos Falls, North Fort and the Wotan River will know defeat!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259UN0037",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lim-Siva",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Day 1 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Savage \n\u0022The Dark Elves have entered this war torn realm! Our objective is two fold we will capture this realm for ourselves and defeat the Elves. The Mountain Clans will be dealt with if they interfere!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Day 1 Mclans ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf King \n\u0022I  want my realm back! Our enemies are everywhere! Be sure to rid the realm of their presence. Do not let your guard down for an instant the Elven Alliance have made their intentions known that  they want our land!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Day 3 Mclans ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf King \n\u0022I captured and slaughtered a White Wizard from the Empire. My axe spilled his blood! A great  white light appeared and his magic fled before my eyes. Some regions on the map offering healing spells. Find them and use them wisely!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Day 3 Elves ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Savage \n\u0022With my own eyes I saw the Dwarf King defeat a White Wizard. A flash of light appeared upon his death. Some say that the Wizard\u0027s magic still resides in this realm healing all those who pass through. Take advantage of this magic!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259UN003b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Weroc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Healing Mclans",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Day 12 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Savage \n\u0022Our enemies gather, I have learned that in the days to come our enemies will be sending in more support. I have sent out word that we will need assistance in our battles. A great warrior makes his way!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mclans Warning ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S259EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf King \n\u0022The are more of our enemies making their way.  I have asked for a great warrior to arrive and even the odds. We must be ready for the battle will become bloodier than ever!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S259SC0000",
